1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,250
Bangs lives in the MacBook notch.

2
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:04,000
The logo shows who's working.
The bars show progress.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,900
Review the build command.
Click Allow in the notch.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,000
A ring counts down to the meeting.
It turns orange near the end.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,700
The agent finished.
Tests passed and changes were committed.

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:14,200
When idle, its eyes follow the pointer.

7
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,000
Bangs supports 15 coding agents.
Free download on the project page.
